window.products.push({"id":961015,"name":"GOOFUN-D3K 3pcs Duvet Cover Set 1 Duvet Cover 2 Pillow Shams Lightweight Microfiber Comfortable, Breathable, Soft, King Size, Light Grey with White Fl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MDlTlJEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Goofun Home Collection Package Includes 1x Duvet cover (Without Comforter) 2x Pillow shams (ONLY 1 piece for Twin-size option) Please note no comforter in set, please make sure you want dovet cover before you make order. Size Information King size Duvet cover: 104\" x 90\" Pillow sham: 20\" x 36\" Full/Queen size Duvet cover: 90\" x 90\" Pillow sham: 20\" x 26\" All dimensions are measured manually with deviation ranged at 1-1.5inches. Material: Micorfiber, feel soft and lightweight, zipper closure. Please note it is lightweight duvet cover not thick. Pattern Brief Description Pattern D3: Mainly color is Grey with White flower. There no blue color in the duvet cover. Please attention here: The pillow pattern is random clipping from the duvet cover. Attention Please, actual color may vary from the color on your screen due to monitor color restrictions. If you don't absolutely love the real color,please return the item. Care Instruction Machine wash with cold water; Do not bleach; Tumble dry, low heat; Iron, Medium; Do not dry-clean Please wash before using. When you open your new set of Goofun Home Collection you¡¯re probably eager to get it on the bed right away. While we can understand your desire to do so, we strongly recommend that you wash bedding before you use it for the first time. Our bedding is quality checked and prepared to be stored while in transit to your home and washing will remove the necessary preservatives. Additionally, washing removes packaging fragrance, dirt, and germs, as well as adds your unique fragrance to your bedding. Please forgive a few small flaws, anyway it is beautiful and worth the price.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MDlTlJEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOOFUN","source_asin":"B01F56HZBU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961015","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01F56HZBU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01F56HZBU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
