window.products.push({"id":961044,"name":"PHILIPS 100 LED Warm White Twinkling Faceted Mini Christmas Lights on Green Wire - UL Listed for Indoor/Outdoor Use - 35.33' Total with 4\" Bulb Spacin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EaGQxtjLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a warm glow to your celebrations with these Philips LED 100lt Twinkling Faceted Mini Lights in warm white color with green wire. The traditional mini bulb shape is perfect for decorating both indoor and outdoors. These energy efficient strings have a lighted length of 33' and a total of 30 sets can be connected end to end for a total of 3,000 lights. Each UL listed set is protected by a 5-Year guarantee from the certified third-party seller.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EaGQxtjLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PHILIPS","source_asin":"B08TGGGZSZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961044","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TGGGZSZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TGGGZSZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
