window.products.push({"id":961046,"name":"Crystal Snowflake Magnetic Wine Glass Charms & Markers for Christmas or Holiday Parties and Gifts- Set of 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41m3GC1z1ZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Made in USA OUR CHARMS WORK ON ALL YOUR WINE GLASSES! This fun new wine accessory uses the power of rare earth magnets to attach THROUGH your wine glass. Therefore they work on other types of glasses and acrylics too, including stemless wine glasses, champagne flutes, martini glasses, and even beer mugs. YOUR GUESTS WILL LOVE THESE! Not only will your guests think these wine markers are fun and different, they will love choosing their charm! Simply have your glasses charmed before everyone arrives and let each guest pick their charm for the evening. Check out all our charm designs, there is one perfect for every occasion, and no one will ever have to ask, “Which glass is mine?” PERFECT FOR A VARIETY OF OCCASIONS: Dinner parties, book club, Bunco night, birthday parties, and holiday gatherings are all great occasions to use wine charms and differentiate everyone’s glass. Our magnetic wine charms are also great to have on hand for hostess gifts, birthdays, teacher gifts, office gift exchanges and stocking stuffers. SIMPLE TO USE Gently place back magnet inside glass near the top of the rim, place charm on the outside of the glass, holding securely until magnets meet. They work on any kind of glass, even acrylic and paper, up to 5 mm in thickness. The magnets will not affect the taste of the beverage, nor will the beverage affect the magnets. Simply return the charms to the package when finished so they are ready for your next occasion. MATCH YOUR CHARMS AND YOUR THEME: Simply Charmed has charms for many holidays and occasions, such as Thanksgiving, Christmas, & St. Patricks Day, as well as designs that embellish all year long . Check out all of our designs and pick up a set so you are ready to impress your guests the next time you entertain! Cheers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41m3GC1z1ZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simply Charmed","source_asin":"B013Q1B0D0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013Q1B0D0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013Q1B0D0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
