window.products.push({"id":961070,"name":"Christmas Ornaments – Firefighter Gifts for Men or Women – Patriotic Ornaments with a Silver Ribbon – Firefighter Classic Fire Maltese Xmas Ornament (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610UTo1QmFL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"Everyone likes to be appreciated in their profession. Give the gift of a personalized firemen ornament to show your fireman that you care about them and what an important job they do. Whether you are searching for a gift to give to a real life hero, or the final piece to complete your decorating, this ornament is a must have!  SHOW YOUR PRIDE: Our firefighter Christmas ornaments are porcelain and feature a beautiful white storage box with the emblem on the box. Our storage box is reusable slotted gift box included for storage when not in use. Includes ribbon as pictured which makes them a great gift for giving.  GUARANTEED: 100% satisfaction guaranteed or your Money Back! If for any reason you are not satisfied with our firefighter XMAS ornaments just return it for a full refund or a replacement on us. We know you will love our patriotic merchandise as much as we do. Each decal on Christmas ornaments are hand applied making sure our quality is impeccable.  GIFT IDEA: Our firefighter merchandise for men or women make the perfect gifts for any occasion: Christmas, Birthday Gifts, Wedding Party, Father’s Day, etc! Our firefighter ornaments are always appropriate to show your pride!  ORNAMENT SIZE: These ornaments are 3.75\" and will fit perfect for any normal sized tree in the 5-9-foot range or to hang on an ornament stand. Our firefighter ornaments are ready to hang straight out of box and come with a pre-looped string. Our firefighter Christmas ornaments are very light weight and will not weigh down the Christmas tree branches.  HEROES: Firefighters spend each and every day waiting to put their lives on the line to provide safety and security to all of us and they deserve to be honored. You or the fireman in your life will love our personalized coasters and remind you of how the sacrifice and service they provide.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610UTo1QmFL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Erazor Bits","source_asin":"B01N0OTFCA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961070","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N0OTFCA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N0OTFCA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":961071,"name":"Cootie Couples Mr Mrs Leather Strap Denim Apron Couples Apron Set, Wedding Gifts for Couple 2021, Newlywed Gifts, Bridal Shower Gifts for Bride, Engag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HcHXkYSyL._AC_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton Denim BE THE POWER COUPLE 💎Our customized matching apron gift set is perfect for any couple who loves to spend time together from cooking, baking, BBQ-ing, or hosting parties. Rest assured, you can still protect your clothes from kitchen nightmares while looking cute! These aprons are the perfect gift set bound to put a smile on their face, turns heads and be the talk of the town! SET AND FORGET PREMIUM QUALITY APRONS 💎Curated for those who believe in quality because the small things matter. We've eliminated the need of tying knots as our comfortable leather straps hug every body shape. Just set and forget and it's goof for all future use! With bold embroidered lettering to reinforced rivets and attachment points, our aprons are made to last. READY, SET, GIFT! 💎 Our hassle-free product comes in a beautifully designed box that is made to be gift ready. Our aprons make the perfect gift for birthdays, engagements, bridal showers, weddings, anniversaries, gifts for her, gifts for him, gifts for friends and family, honeymoon gifts, romantic gifts, or even housewarming gifts. We even threw in a wooden beech spoon to get the party started! EASY MACHINE WASH 💎 Cleaning dirty aprons is the last thing on your mind after cooking up a storm and tackling the mountain of dishes. Luckily, our aprons are made so that the straps are easily removable for washing purposes. Leather straps are easily adjustable to any size for maximum coverage. Meaning...more wine time! 100% REFUND GUARANTEE ✔️ Our clients deserve the very best and we make it a core value at our company. If you are not completely satisfied with your purchase, feel free to reach out to us for any comments or concerns and we will happily address them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HcHXkYSyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cootie Couples","source_asin":"B081J9N8SF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961071","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081J9N8SF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081J9N8SF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":961072,"name":"Put Another Log on the Fire - Great Gift - Valentine's Day","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DJ3Y4K51L._AC_.jpg","description":"Heat up your romantic relationship with Put Another Log on the Fire! A refrigerator magnet game for two, Put Another Log on the Fire lets couples track the progress of their relationship -- and perhaps even get some real communication done -- in a playful and imaginative way. Fuel up your relationship with good times and romantic moments like weekends away, boxes of chocolate, and fabulous sex, and you Put Another Log on the Fire. Too much fuel and not enough oxygen? Maybe a Girl’s Night Out, a spa treatment or a round of golf is just what you need. Anticipation, spontaneous gifts, heart-warming moments and healthy time apart. All make for a great relationship and Put Another Log on the Fire brings it all together in a fun, relationship-building way. Package includes 89 game pieces, one backdrop piece, and directions for play. How hot is your relationship? Maybe you need to Put Another Log on the Fire!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DJ3Y4K51L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Put Another Log on the Fire - Great Gift - Valentine's Day","source_asin":"B000BUWGR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000BUWGR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000BUWGR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":961073,"name":"DII Provence Portofino Premium Bath Collection Lightweight and Absorbent, Large Bath Set, Paprika Red 6 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X4NwTw6aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Turn your bathroom into a luxurious retreat with this deluxe 6-piece towel set. Made from durable 100% combed cotton this 6-piece bath towel set includes 2 Bath Towels 27 x 52 Inch, 2 Hand Towels 16 x 27 Inch and 2 Washcloths 13 x 13 Inch. You'll enjoy unparalleled softness and absorbency, as the fibers are tightly woven to quickly wick moisture from your body. Plus, this 6-piece towel set is not only easy to clean - it becomes softer and fluffier with each machine wash and dry. The plush look of these towels will perfectly complement your bathroom accessory sets and lend an elegant look to your decor. You can choose from a variety of beautiful colors. From the Manufacturer J&M Home Fashions is a direct importer and wholesale company with distribution to both retailers and e-commerce channels. J&M has grown to become one of the most respected names in home fashion through innovation, service, quality and commitment to global manufacturing capabilities. With over 60 years of experience, J&M has a unique expertise in design, manufacturing and delivery – providing customers with excellent quality products at affordable pricing. Our products span the market spectrum and we consistently deliver the highest quality for value in the industry. J&M Home Fashions offers fashionable, fun and functional rugs, educational children's rugs, doormats, utility mats, blankets, throws, kitchen textiles, bath towel ensembles, bath rugs, beach towels, shower products and more…for the home. Within these categories we offer variety, including everyday basic looks and seasonal collections for Back to School, Halloween, Fall/Harvest, Christmas/Holiday, and Spring & Summer. Our offerings incorporate the hottest colors and themes bringing you fresh, innovative products for every season, every holiday, every home, and everyone","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X4NwTw6aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DII","source_asin":"B00GGDA1AE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961073","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GGDA1AE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GGDA1AE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
