window.products.push({"id":961190,"name":"Fshopping foldable toast bread slicer bread uniform cutting","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oL1vItsdL._AC_SL1060_.jpg","description":"Features:  Specially design to slice bread, ham, cheese quickly and evenly.  Foldable bread slicing guide, easy to store and saving your cupboard room.  Easy to clean it. Slightly wipe it and wash with the water.  The tines are more elastic, not easy to be broken in case wrong operation.  Tines is designed with a little radian in line to clamp the bread effectively.  Sliced thickness: 10MM, also can slice different thickness through using two gaps.  Material: food-grade PP  Product size( outside size/unfold): L24xW14.5xH19cm =L9.45xW5.71xH7.48 inch   How to unfold/fold:  Firstly stay to press the button on the bottom on which has a transparent label points out the direction, then slightly turn the tines by hand, then release the button.   How to correctly use the knife to slice the bread: Press down the prongs/tines with fingers/palm, NOT CLAMP the prongs/tines with fingers. Please get the blade VERTICAL, move forward & backward the blade between two tines, don’t let SHARP SIDE of the knife TOUCH the tines while cutting down so that avoid shaving off the plastic. keeping sharp side of the knife Vertical is very important! when being close to the bottom, no need to use a big strength, please slightly cut the bread and lift the knife to avoid cutting the bottom.   Package:  1x toast bread slicer  1x English user operation manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oL1vItsdL._AC_SL1060_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fshopping","source_asin":"B01LWI56MS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LWI56MS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LWI56MS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
