window.products.push({"id":961313,"name":"Air Fryer Liners 100 Pcs | Perforated holes for crispy food | Unbleached Disposable Parchment Paper Liner Sheets | Oil-proof High heat resistant - Air","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RSydbN5SL._AC_SL1181_.jpg","description":"[ Convenient and Easy Clean up ]: If you are tired of cleaning up grease and food residue off your air fryer basket, tray and pan, look no further. This precut liner will reduce your clean up and save you a lot of time, so you can focus on your food and are able to use your air fryer conveniently and make the most of it! [ Multi-use ]: Suitable for air fryers, microwave, oven etc. Best fits 5 quart and larger pots. Compatible with all types of pots: Square, rectangular, round Adjustable size works with most pot sizes. Just press the side open. Use to cook meat, French fries, Baked potatoes, Fish, Vegetables, Bread, Cookies, fritto misto, Round shape allows to bake pizza and more! Compatible with all air fryers: Instant pot vortex, gourmia, ninja, Cosori, Breville, GoWise, Cuisinart, Philips, Dash and the rest! [ Allows Air Circulation ]: Perforated holes allow the air and heat to cook from underneath the food just like a normal basket. Unlike our competitor sellers, this liner the food to be crispy and cook thoroughly. Does not isolate hot air flow like SILICONE liners. NO SOGGY FOOD. NO UNHEALTHY UNDERCOOKED FOOD. [ Healthy Material ]: Made with best food-grade wood parchment or baking paper, no effect on taste, non-stick. NO WAX. NO WHITE BLEACHED PAPER. NON TOXIC. [ WARNING ]: DO NOT USE IN AIR FRYER WITHOUT FOOD. If used without the weight of food, the liner may fly and may burn. DO NOT let the liner touch the burner/tube of the airfryer which is much hotter than the allowable temperature for the liner. DO NOT use for pre-heat Thank you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RSydbN5SL._AC_SL1181_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0B41QDRHW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961313","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B41QDRHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B41QDRHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
