window.products.push({"id":961343,"name":"Day Of The Dead Chef's Apron Mexican Sugar Skull Honor Death Holiday Tradition Black One Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8183uyAbc5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Celebrate your heritage and the dead with this cool design! Our T-shirts, hoodies, sweats and other products are all printed to order in the UK, using top quality, digital, full color print technology. Your genuine Tim and Ted product will be lovingly manufactured in the city of Bristol, packed with great care and shipped rapidly to you anywhere in the world. We are confident that you'll love your Tim and Ted branded product, so much so, that we gladly offer a no-quibble satisfaction guarantee as standard. We care about quality, that's why we only use pre-shrunk apparel to eliminate shrinkage and misshaping. Comfort and above all, safety, are our key values. As a result, all of our products comply to the OEKO-TEX 100 standards. We've got your back! Whether its a special occasion or just a treat, with personalized message and wrapping options available for him or her, our Aprons make the perfect gift idea or present for all your friends and family. Why not treat dad to a hoodie for Fathers Day? Or surprise mum with an apron for Mothers Day? Last minute Valentines gift for your boyfriend or girlfriend? We want you to look cool, so check out our other listings for more awesome apron designs from birth years, catchy slogans and quotes to the just downright funny. Aprons:* 100% cotton twill for strength.* Pre-shrunk to eliminate extra shrinking while washing.* WRAP Certified Production.* Length from waist 62cm.* Total length 87cm.How do I wash my product?To keep your product looking as good as possible, for as long as possible, wash inside-out at 30 degrees Celcius","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8183uyAbc5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tim And Ted","source_asin":"B07YDQZN6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YDQZN6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YDQZN6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":961344,"name":"Alfi La Ola 1-Liter Carafe, Ice Blue and Light Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31WAC5109DL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Alfi's Laola is a slender frosted ice-blue and light yellow carafe with screw stopper is constructed of high quality polypropylene. Equipped with Alfi's double-walled vacuum glass liner which keeps liquids hot or cold for up to 13 hours. Hand wash with warm soapy water. 1-liter or 8-cup capacity. From the Manufacturer The world leader in high-quality thermal carafes, Alfi designs and produces products with aesthetic appeal and superior performance. Employing cutting-edge technology, state-of-the art materials, and the craftsmanship of world-renowned designers, Alfi elevates the common carafe to a work of scientific and artistic excellence. In addition, only environmental-friendly technical equipment is used in the manufacture of Alfi products. The La Ola Carafe features the AlfiDur vacuum hard glass liner, a high-quality polypropylene \"frosted\" surface, and a screw stopper. The double-walled AlfiDur vacuum hard glass liner keeps hot drinks hot and cold drinks cold. Before assembly each glass liner undergoes an operational test. Other outstanding features include: The hinged lid provides single-hand operation and is food safe. The hinged lid provides single-hand operation and is food safe. The twin-walled AlfiDur toughened hard glass liner creates a vacuum between the walls, allowing neither heat nor cold to escape; 100-percent performance tested. The twin-walled AlfiDur toughened hard glass liner creates a vacuum between the walls, allowing neither heat nor cold to escape; 100-percent performance tested. The seal prevents the escape of radiant heat. The seal prevents the escape of radiant heat. The body of the flask is comprised of high-quality raw materials e.g. copper and brass. Top quality is achieved by hand craftsmanship. The body of the flask is comprised of high-quality raw materials e.g. copper and brass. Top quality is achieved by hand craftsmanship. The seals/screw fittings are food-safe and quality-tested. Each part can be replaced or repaired. The Designer Julian Brown is a top designer with a distinguished career. He studied mechanical engineering and industrial design at the Royal College of Art, where he also works today as an external teacher of industrial design. His characteristic formal style has been greatly influenced by periods spent in Japan, Austria, and Berlin. A style which numerous companies around the world regard highly, and which he has given expression to quite brilliantly in his product creations as many international design awards go to prove Julian Brown has already duplicated his talent for Alfi numerous times. The result is the vacuum jug Pump & Go and the two award-winning designs Basic and La Ola. They demonstrate the fruitful fusion of quality and innovation. Julian Brown's own words about La Ola: \"The La Ola design is outstanding for its simplicity, and the principle of the wave just waiting to be discovered.\" The seals/screw fittings are food-safe and quality-tested. Each part can be replaced or repaired. The Designer Julian Brown is a top designer with a distinguished career. He studied mechanical engineering and industrial design at the Royal College of Art, where he also works today as an external teacher of industrial design. His characteristic formal style has been greatly influenced by periods spent in Japan, Austria, and Berlin. A style which numerous companies around the world regard highly, and which he has given expression to quite brilliantly in his product creations as many international design awards go to prove Julian Brown has already duplicated his talent for Alfi numerous times. The result is the vacuum jug Pump & Go and the two award-winning designs Basic and La Ola. They demonstrate the fruitful fusion of quality and innovation. Julian Brown's own words about La Ola: \"The La Ola design is outstanding for its simplicity, and the principle of the wave just waiting to be discovered.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31WAC5109DL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alfi","source_asin":"B000IAFD36","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000IAFD36","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000IAFD36","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
