window.products.push({"id":961408,"name":"3-section Rectangle Wicker Basket | Toilet Paper Storage - Bathroom Vanity Tray - Kitchen Counter Storage Bin - Woven Shelf Divider Storage Box - By M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R31oa+AkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE- This basket is an attractive solution to your problem of storage in every home space. In the bathroom, it is an ideal over the tank basket or a vanity tray for toiletries, tissue rolls and towels In the pantry, the basket serves as an adorable storage baskets for garlic, onions and seasoning bottles. It is also a lovely drawer divider basket for you to organize in the closet. Various usages come in just one basket! SMART SIZE & DESIGN- The rectangular shape with straight sides means you can put in items like bottles or tubes without having them flop over. It is also made with a considerable depth so that it is easier to access the smaller items without you having to dig around the basket to find. The two outer compartments are slightly larger than the middle one, allowing you to fit and store more. TIMELESS BEAUTY- This basket is woven from seagrass/ Waterhyacinth. Thanks to the use of natural materials, this 3-section basket brings with itself warmth and rustic beauty. The bright natural color goes hand in hand with the vintage, farmhouse design of the basket. It is also woven strongly, carefully shaped and handled by the skillful hands of our artisans, making sure it stays in shape even after a long time in use THE HARMONY OF BEAUTY & FUNCTION- Not only is our 3-section basket a multi-functional organizer, it is also a charming, unique addition to your home decoration. Handwoven from seagrass, the basket brings a vibe of French rural nostalgia. Thanks to the simple yet natural colors, the basket blends in well with many decoration tones and styles, from Farmhouse, Premitive, Mid-century, Bohemian to Modern or Minimalism. HANDCRAFTED BY LOCAL ARTISANS - Our 3-section storage basket, just as every item sold under the brand name of MadeTerra, is handcrafted by the very hands of skilled artisans in the old traditional village of Kim Son, Vietnam. All of our products are handmade, so the actual pieces may vary slightly in color and size from the images shown online.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R31oa+AkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeTerra","source_asin":"B09HZMDPLG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HZMDPLG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HZMDPLG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
