window.products.push({"id":961555,"name":"Cuisinart CNP-511 Ceramic Non Stick Grill Platter, 12 by 16-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lsqfgUJ2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Cuisinart Ceramic Non-Stick Grill toppers were created to provide you with a more eco conscious option that looks as good as it performs. This 16\" x 12\" grill platter is coated in a ceramic non-stick finish that is PFOA, PTFE and Cadmium Free. Ceramic non-stick coatings also have a higher heat tolerance than traditional non-stick options making these even more ideal for the high demands of grilling. We've also redesigned the grid pattern to allow for maximum grilling performance while maintaining durability. This grill platter is the perfect addition to any gas or charcoal grill to provide you with an easy to cook and easy to clean surface for all those difficult foods. NOTE: This platter is not dishwasher safe and as with typical non-stick we recommend using nylon, wood or bamboo tools to prevent chipping and scratching the surface. Features: Ceramic nonstick coating is PFOA, PTFE and Cadmium Free|Ceramic coating has higher heat tolerance than traditional nonstick|Nonstick makes it easier to grill and clean up after tough foods","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lsqfgUJ2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinart","source_asin":"B00F3BH7V6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961555","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00F3BH7V6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00F3BH7V6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":961556,"name":"Large Bamboo Stash Box w/Ample Storage Space to Organize Herb Accessories - Comes with Convertible Rolling Tray Lid - (10\" x 8\" x 3.5\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817bBeCasyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Ultimate Smoking Companion This is the all-in-one stash box for all your smoking and marijuana accessories. While most boxes in the market today are usually too small or low-quality so we wanted to create a box that will blow the competition out of the water. From the storage space to functionality and elegant, but discrete design, the Subtle Box is the ultimate organizer for all your smoking essentials. Hide Your Goods From Wandering Eyes Do you live with nosy parents or roommates that are constantly all up in your business? Maybe members of your household disapprove of your smoking habits? Well, we kept that in mind when designing this box. From the discrete, yet tasteful logo design and placement to the storage capacity of the box itself, this box is designed for smokers by smokers. Keep all your smoking valuables in one central location and away from lurking eyes with ease. Ample Storage Space Let’s face it, we smokers have a lot of “stuff” to keep track of. From papers, grinders, jars, containers, flowers, lighters, wraps, pipes, the list can go on and on. That is why our box is 2x or 3x the size of most our competitors. The extra storage space accommodates your most important equipment so you can easily have all your goods in one spot and not laying around the eyes for others to see or steal! Multi-Functional Uses Not only is the Subtle box a beautifully designed stash box, but it also doubles as a practical rolling tray. Simply flip the lid over and place it directly on top of the bottom section of the box seamlessly and wa-lah!, you’ve got yourself a rolling tray. Now that is what we call convenience. Dimensions & Material 10” long x 8” long x 3.5” tall. Our boxes are made from durable and all natural bamboo wood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817bBeCasyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Subtle","source_asin":"B0BMJDTN4W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961556","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMJDTN4W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMJDTN4W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
