window.products.push({"id":961644,"name":"Automatic Liquid Soap Dispenser, 10oz/300ml Soap Dispenser Touchless Hand Sanitizer Dispenser Type-C Rechargeable Sensor Liquid Soap Pump Dispenser fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tvY0qqQbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌺【Touch-free Soap Dispenser】-- Neat, easy and automatic liquid soap pump dispenser. This automatic soap dispenser is touchless operation,which means no germs passed on, and no smudges left behind. Touchless soap dispenser equipped with high-precision infrared sensor, soap could be dispensed in 0.25 seconds. Move hands to sensor area and get soap. Keep hands cleaner with less contact than using a pump bottle. 🌺【Large Capacity Soap Dispenser For Bathroom】-- The dish soap dispenser has a large capacity of 10oz can be used for up to one season once filled, and the liquid can be dispenser up to 9000 times. The super-large capacity automatic soap dispenser can avoid frequent addition of liquid. CLOG-FREE TUBING PUMP - For precise and consistent soap flow. This practical and beautiful bathroom soap dispenser will be a perfect gift for friends or relatives. 🌺【Three Gears Adjustable Liquid Soap Dispenser】-- Our rechargeable sensor liquid soap pump dispenser is 3 levels adjustable, different color indicator lights indicate different soap volume: White(Low), blue(Mid), green(High). NOTE: 1. BOOT UP：white light on for 2s; 2. SHUT DOWN: red light flashes 3 times in 1s. Please according to the different needs of adults and children to use soap, you can adjust the gears according to your needs to avoid waste. 🌺【Bathroom Soap Dispenser With Rechargeable Design】-- This soap dispenser for kitchen designed with 1200 mAh built-in battery, which has better sealing performance, avoiding the battery being wetted by water or rusted from damaging the soap dispenser. There is no need to replace the battery and the charging time is only 1.5h, it can be used continuously for 90 days, and the standby state can be maintained for more than 108 days. 🌺【Add Aromatherapy To Automatic Liquid Soap Dispenser To Improve the Air】-- You can add aromatherapy tablets to the top cover of bathroom soap dispenser to bring lasting fresh air to the bathroom. IPX5 waterproof: Do not worry about splashing water in bathroom; Rubber plug keeps Type C charging port free from humidity. This versatile bathroom countertop soap dispensers ideal for using in bathroom, kitchen, office, school, hospital, etc. 🌺【2-Year Warranty for Automatic Soap Dispenser & Warm Tips】-- We promise to provide a 2-year warranty for your order, please feel free to contact us if any request or problem. 🌟🌟NOTE: 1. Using the regular liquid soap otherwise it will clog. 2. Soap dispenser won't work during charging, So please remove charging cable after fully charged before turning it on. 3. When charging the red light is flashing, Fully charged the red light long on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tvY0qqQbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Florsol","source_asin":"B0BYRTTMQ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYRTTMQ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYRTTMQ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
