window.products.push({"id":961659,"name":"FINDAMAZE Sunglasses Organizer Wood Sunglasses Storage Wall Mounted Eyeglasses Holder Eyewear Display,Home Decor, (Lake Blue-1pcs-long)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KY0+PoyKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. Simple style sunglass organizer for wall. We designed four board colors, white, gray, natural wood, and lake blue. There is always a color that suits the style of your home walls. These sunglasses display stand with nine cowhide straps. You can hang up to 9 sunglasses on it without taking up any other space. When your friends visit your house, they will see all your sunglasses for the first time. Everything is organized. Say goodbye to the messy desktop. 2. The best sunglass holder. Could you hang this sunglasses holder on the wall by the entrance? Always have your sunglasses on hand when you head out. Everyone nearsighted will worry about where to put the myopia mirror before going to bed. Hang one on the wall next to the bed, and no longer worry about finding glasses after getting up. It can also be installed next to a desk in the bathroom. I would say goodbye to the trouble of not finding sunglasses or eyeglasses. 3. This glasses holder has two installation methods. Easy to install, you only need to tear off the 3M adhesive on the back, and you can easily install it anywhere you need. Don't worry about it falling off; the maximum weight capacity is over 20 lbs. We made two holes in the back for hanging and provided all mounting accessories. You can use screw installation to adjust the installation position anytime. 4. This eyeglasses holder is made of natural bamboo and leather. The sunglass hook is made of soft leather to prevent scratches on the frame. Safer than metal hooks. This is our original design and is the latest on the market. Appearance and use patents have been applied for. 5.If you have a friend who likes sunglasses or wears myopia, this is the best gift for him/her. This gift is perfect for any occasion, Birthday, Valentine's Day, Father's Day, Mother's Day, Housewarming, Anniversary, Christmas, Thanksgiving and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KY0+PoyKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FINDAMAZE","source_asin":"B0BRS87QZL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961659","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRS87QZL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRS87QZL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
