window.products.push({"id":961688,"name":"VitaJuwel ViA Heat Forever Young | Double-Walled Tea Bottle with Aquamarine, Aventurine, Smoky Quartz & Clear Quartz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":138.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xoHOFgKWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE HEAT IS ON. This Crystal Infusion Bottle with genuine gems features lab-quality, double-walled glass for insulation. Enjoy the sparkle of your favorite gemstone blend inside the bottle while brewing your tea on-the-go with the (optional) extra-large tea strainer. Stays cool to the touch. Crystal vibes for your hot or cool drink. Engineered in the German Alps. Made in Germany. FOREVER YOUNG |Aventurine, Aquamarine, Smoky Quartz & Clear Quartz CLEANSING / DETOX STRESS-RELIEF SERENITY CRYSTAL VIBES. Our 12.2 fl.oz. insulating glass bottle with a holistic blend of genuine crystals infuses your warm or cool drink with positive energy on-the-go. Naturopathic doctors have been using the vibrant energy of precious stones to prepare potent crystal elixirs for their therapies for many years. With the help of gemologists we’ve reinterpreted this tradition and created a select number of unique crystal blends aimed at specific crystal attributes. VERSATILE & PRACTICAL. Choose one of 13 traditional gemstone blends. Enjoy your loose leaf tea with the (optional) large capacity, stainless steel tea strainer. ViA HEAT is easy to clean, due to the two openings of the glass part. SUSTAINABLE. Stop using paper cups from your coffee shop and let them fill your ViA HEAT instead. ViA HEAT is 100% BPA-free. FOREVER YOUNG... is designed to attract clarity, purity and fluidity like a natural mountain spring water on a crisp clear day. If your personal detox practices are important to you in these hectic times, the Forever Young blend offers an additional dimension of energetic cleansing. Aventurine has been used for regenerative purposes, aquamarine for cleansing and smoky quartz for stress relief. In the natural healing arts, this combination provides an invigorating cleanse of body and mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xoHOFgKWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VitaJuwel","source_asin":"B09NDN3LBZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NDN3LBZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NDN3LBZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
