window.products.push({"id":961697,"name":"Meat Thermometer, Cooking Thermometer [5.8 Inch Long Probe] with Instant Read, LCD Screen, Hold Function for Kitchen Food Smoker Grill BBQ Meat Candy ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EfxFOiWOL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"Features： Instant Read LCD display shows accurate temperature results in few seconds, hitch makes the perfect cooking thermometer for meat, poultry, liquids, BBQ, grilling, baking and making candy. Humane Design The slender probe tip avoids putting huge puncture holes in your foods which means the meat juices stay in the meat where they belong. Easy to Use Simply insert the long temperature probe into your food /liquid and get perfectly cooked food every single time. The 4.90 inch stainless probe is long enough to keep you from burning your hands while measuring. Easy to stab in the food with the slender probe tip, it can get temperature more precisely and quickly. Widely Use Work on all types of foods, make cooking and grilling easier. Perfect for indoor or outdoor use. You instantly become your own unstoppable kitchen master chef! Extensive Temperature  Range This cooking thermometer allows extensive temperature ranging from -58 °F to +572 °F (-50 °C to +300 °C), distinguishing rate: 0.1 °C, perfect for meat, poultry, BBQ, smoker, grilling, beer, milk, soup,candy and more. Handy Storage Case Put your thermometer in this unique slim-fitting case which comes with a funky easy-grip handle. Package included: 1 x Cooking Thermometer 1 x LR44 battery 1 x  Plastic tube Notice: 1. Do not leave thermometer in oven while cooking, do not touch hot probe with bare hands. 2. Before withdrawing from food, press HOLD button. It will \"hold\" the temperature reading. 3. Do not submerse the unit in water or place it in dishwater. BE CAREFUL NOT TO GET WATER IN THE THERMOMETER AS THE TOP ELECTRONIC PART IS NOT WATERPROOF. 4.NEVER use the thermometer in a closed oven.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EfxFOiWOL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"detaiyirongshangmao","source_asin":"B07R7GGMQD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R7GGMQD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R7GGMQD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
