window.products.push({"id":961839,"name":"OXO 1437180 Good Grips Pop-Up Cookbook Holder,White/Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71URDObaWaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OXO Good Grips Pop-Up Cookbook Holder: Keep your cookbook upright and ready for use with the OXO Good Grips Pop-Up Cookbook Holder. The Cookbook Holder auto-opens for easy loading and can accommodate very thick and tall books without tipping over. The clear splatter screen holds cookbooks securely in place and upright at an easy-to-read angle without distorting words or images. The screen easily pulls down, allowing you to turn the page with one hand. When you’re finished, simply fold up the Cookbook Holder for easy storage – the slim design makes it perfect for storing with cookbooks on bookshelves or flat in cabinets or drawers. It’s the Little Things: At OXO, we consistently develop products that address even the tiniest of pet peeves, because we know it’s the little things that make the biggest difference. We purposefully didn’t include non-slip feet on the Cookbook Holder, because we felt that being able to slide the product while cooking (with a forearm or an elbow if your hands are dirty) was more useful than having it stuck in place and needing to stop, clean your hands, pick it up and move it to make room for another bowl or cutting board. Features & Benefits: Stable: Securely holds cookbooks, magazines and tablet computers without tipping Stable: Securely holds cookbooks, magazines and tablet computers without tipping Protects: Splatter guard keeps pages and screens clean without distorting words or images Protects: Splatter guard keeps pages and screens clean without distorting words or images Easy loading: Holder auto-opens for easy placement of books or tablets Easy loading: Holder auto-opens for easy placement of books or tablets One-handed use: Screen easily pulls down for one-handed page turning or scrolling One-handed use: Screen easily pulls down for one-handed page turning or scrolling Secure: Recipes are held in place at an upright and easy-to-read angle Secure: Recipes are held in place at an upright and easy-to-read angle Storage: Slim design allows for easy storage on bookshelves or flat in cabinets or drawers Storage: Slim design allows for easy storage on bookshelves or flat in cabinets or drawers Good Tip: From the kitchen to the library or office, this product functions as a textbook holder for homework or a book holder at the computer. Forget struggling to juggle a book in one hand and type or study with the other, and treat yourself to carefree, easy two-handed work! OXO is dedicated to providing innovative consumer products that make everyday living easier. How do we do it? We study people – lefties and righties, male and female, young and old – interacting with products and identify ways to make them better. Our “question everything” process and relentless attention to detail uncover the best solutions for slicing, peeling, whisking, baking, stirring, washing, scrubbing, dusting, storing and organizing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71URDObaWaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OXO","source_asin":"B007UEA0CM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961839","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007UEA0CM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007UEA0CM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
