window.products.push({"id":961947,"name":"Magnetic Spice Rack Organizer Refrigerator Spice Storage Shelf（Red 2 pack with hook）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51v-r7dhL7S._AC_SL1356_.jpg","description":"✅Awesome Spice Rack: Made of high-quality thick steel, it is durable and has super-strong magnets on the back. The surface is treated with black matte finish. It fits perfectly into your kitchen. ✅ Easy to Use; No drilling or assembly required. The magnet is remarkably strong, it can bear 5 pounds. Easy to be attached to the side of refrigerator or other iron surfaces. Would not gradually slide down the fridge. ✅ Wide range of use: Eased up your cabinet space and made your spices and extracts easier to find. It is a very good storage rack, suitable for spices, pepper, salt, sugar, Jar of olive oil, cooking oils, pepper, or other small things. ✅ Size and Weight: 9.7\" L x 4.35\" W x 3.4\" H; 1.7 pounds. ✅Quality Assured: 30-Day money back","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51v-r7dhL7S._AC_SL1356_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hoopoton","source_asin":"B08M3DRDJG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961947","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M3DRDJG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M3DRDJG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":961948,"name":"Initial Personalized Red Alder Wooden Cutting Board - Custom Engraved 11 x 16-Inch, Chopping and Serving Boards, Wedding and Housewarming Gifts, Add I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fsksaEjOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"***Timeless Touches for Hearth and Home***Create a decorative display that is all your own! Lillian Vernon’s Personalized Initial Wooden Cutting Board is a beautiful yet practical home essential, with laser-engraved solid red alder that adds an elegant touch to your kitchen or dining area. Our versatile boards are designed with convenient side trenches to capture moisture. The natural wood grain block is stunning and unique, with charming custom detailing that makes each piece truly exceptional. Each 11 x 16-inch rectangular serving platter is carefully crafted and sturdy enough for daily use. They are ideal for parties and entertaining and can be used to serve food, drink, or condiments. From bread and butter to brisket to pizza or turkey slices, your guests will be grazing in style. These low-maintenance cutting boards are easy to clean, and can simply be wiped down as needed. To make each piece truly your own, click the Customize Now button to add an initial and name up to 18 characters long. We will personalize your board with a classic font that is laser engraved into the center of the smooth wooden surface.This timeless kitchen accessory is perfect for decorating with seasonal details that make every gathering special and unique. Add a personal touch to your wedding registry or celebrate your favorite happy couple. With classic inspirations, our monogrammed cutting board upgrades any space and makes a great gift for friends and family of all ages. They are a personal and thoughtful way to show newlyweds, new homeowners, and loved ones how much you care.At Lillian Vernon, we aim to carry on the legacy of our founder. Since 1951, we have designed memorable gifts that bring people together and celebrate life’s momentous occasions. With an expansive catalog of thoughtful gifts and personalized options, we specialize in crafting decorative details with exceptional quality that make a house feel like home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fsksaEjOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lillian Vernon","source_asin":"B0BNW91HNS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961948","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNW91HNS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNW91HNS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
