window.products.push({"id":961990,"name":"Ivellow 100% Viscose from Bamboo Sheets King Size 18”-24” Deep Pocket Bamboo King Sheets, 4Pcs Grey King Bed Sheets Luxury Bamboo Cooling Sheets for H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":84.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rJGD0TMgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Cooling Bed Sheets Set】Queen bed sheets are designed to provide you with that luxurious, smooth silky feel.100% Viscose from Bamboo without any other added ingredients, Treat Yourself to the Softest with the cooling Sheets Set and Make the most of your sleep hours with the most comfortable sheets that will let you drift off and wake up refreshed the next day. 【Breathable Cooling Sheets with Silk Feel】Our cooling sheets fabric is soft like the finest cotton or silk, it can adjust to your body temperature, keep you cool and relaxed while sleeping and providing all season comfort. It has very fast wicking properties that allow it to be 3-4 times more absorbent than cotton, it means you will stay cooler in the summer and in the winter the fabrics are warm but at the same time allowing more air between you and your skin, so overheating is prevented. 【Extra Deep Pocket King Sheets Set】Our deep pocket fitted sheets King has extra deep pocket that fit mattresses up to 18\"-24\" deep with added stretch and durable elastic 360° around the fitted sheet, these sheets grip and fit better than any other sheet set! Luxury king Bed sheet set is designed to fit nearly all mattresses, especially thick mattresses, double pillow-top mattresses, memory foam toppers, big mattress pads, or air mattresses... 【4 Piece King Bed Sheets Set】King sheets set includes 1 flat sheet (108\"x102\"), 1 fitted sheet (78\"x80\") and 2 pillow cases (20\"x40\"). Our cooling fitted sheet is 20 inch deep, it can stretch to fit the mattress up to 24\"inches. A gripping all-around elastic band can hold them in place and bring you a perfect restful sleep. Silky texture bamboo sheet set is softer than Egyptian cotton sheets and designed to soften with each wash ensuring increasingly cozy nights over time. 【EASY CARE, HYPOALLERGENIC】These cooling King sheets deep pocket are durable and machine washable, shrink and fade resistant. Wash your bamboo bedding in cold water on a gentle cycle, air dry on the line or tumble dry on a low temperature. Unlike other materials, bamboo in textile form is able to retain many of the properties that it has as a plant. It has a naturally smooth drape especially if you promptly remove it from the dryer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rJGD0TMgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ivellow","source_asin":"B0BD8P9WKR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-961990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD8P9WKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD8P9WKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
